The keyword spotter (kws.kmodel) was trained by Catalyst Linux on the
Speech Commands dataset, version 0.02:

  Pete Warden, "Speech Commands: A Dataset for Limited-Vocabulary Speech
  Recognition", arXiv:1804.03209, 2018.
  http://download.tensorflow.org/data/speech_commands_v0.02.tar.gz

